cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "MultipleScatteringCalculations: elastic multiple scattering from cubic heterogeneities"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nestor
    given-names: T. M.
    affiliation: "Independent researcher, Australia"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tmnestor/MultipleScatteringCalculations"
abstract: >-
  Code, symbolic derivations and validation scripts for elastic multiple scattering from cubic
  heterogeneities by the T-matrix method: the single-site T-matrix of a cube, the inter-site Green's
  tensor, and the Foldy-Lax multiple-scattering solve. Accompanies the paper "The continuum limit of a
  space-filling layer of cubes: a tiling identity, an exact lattice kernel and the closed-form error of
  the discrete layer".
keywords:
  - seismic wave scattering
  - elastic multiple scattering
  - T-matrix
  - Foldy-Lax
  - volume integral equation
  - voxel discretisation
  - continuum limit
